### Health
GET http://parrepos.local/health

### Login
POST http://parrepos.local/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@demo.local",
  "password": "Admin12345!"
}

### Refresh
POST http://parrepos.local/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

